valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02014;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">1&#x02009;<italic>&#x003bc;</italic><sc>M</sc> CA4P</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">4288</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">82</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">5&#x02009;<italic>&#x003bc;</italic><sc>M</sc> CA4P</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1961</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">97</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">5&#x02009;<italic>&#x003bc;</italic><sc>M</sc> 2ME2</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">7624</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">62</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">50&#x02009;<italic>&#x003bc;</italic><sc>M</sc> 2ME2</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">3256</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">88</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">5&#x02009;<italic>&#x003bc;</italic><sc>M</sc> Palomid 529</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">17&#x02009;036</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">8</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">50&#x02009;<italic>&#x003bc;</italic><sc>M</sc> Palomid 529</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">17&#x02009;129</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">7</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="t2-fn1"><label/><p>The assay shows displacement of 5&#x02009;<italic>&#x003bc;</italic><sc>M</sc> [<sup>3</sup>H]colchicine on 1&#x02009;<italic>&#x003bc;</italic><sc>M</sc> tubulin by test agents. Combretastatin-A4-phosphate (CA4P): a microtubule-destabilizing agent. CPM: counts per minute.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>